# Item 739: at the root a held callable's call goes through l2_mad_call, which carries one input;
# a header of two formals called with one actual is refused, located, rather than run with a
# missing argument.  Mutant: no header check -- l2trans accepts.
fn: makePair (int: n) fn: (int: x; int: y) int
    fn: pairN (int: x; int: y) int
        return: x + y + n
    return: pairN

p5: makePair 5
int: a (p5: 1)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: a; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
